wake_alarm_irq=E-SAP-0035: IRQ2 rises at every whole-second alarm occurrence (RPT=Second, ALML=0, clock epoch 1970-01-01), first wake at virtual_time_ns=1000000000; pinned by tests/devices/test_sapporo_rtc.c (test_second_alarm_law)
